# NIST Cybersecurity Framework Gap Analysis

## Executive Summary

Conducted a NIST Cybersecurity Framework (CSF) assessment for Unidad Web, a cloud services provider operating a hybrid infrastructure consisting of Windows, UNIX, and Linux systems.

The objective was to evaluate existing security controls, measure framework alignment, identify security gaps, and create a remediation roadmap to improve organizational cybersecurity maturity.

---

# Organization Overview

Unidad Web provides:

- Website Hosting
- Email Services
- Content Management Systems
- Secure Cloud Storage

The company supports over 5,000 customers and manages sensitive information requiring strong cybersecurity governance and compliance practices.

